# Optional. When set, the enquiry forms POST JSON here instead of opening a
# mailto: link. No backend ships with this project — point it at whatever form
# service you use (Formspree, Basin, a Cloudflare Worker, …).
#
# Copy this file to .env inside the site you want to configure, e.g.
#   site-1-official/.env
#
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://example.com/api/enquiry
